  {
    "id": "wh-383409",
    "source": "wowhead",
    "dateRaw": "Tue, 13 Oct 2026 19:40:40 -0500",
    "author": "Wowhead Staff",
    "category": "Live",
    "badgeColor": "border-amber-500/60 bg-amber-950/80 text-amber-300",
    "title": {
      "en": "Multiple Bugs Preventing Progress in Labyrinths",
      "es": "Múltiples errores que impiden el progreso en los laberintos"
    },
    "summary": {
      "en": "Multiple Bugs Preventing Progress in Labyrinths...",
      "es": "Múltiples errores que impiden el progreso en los laberintos..."
    },
    "contentHtml": "\n            <div id=\"news-post-6acfad570c34f7.62699423\" data-insert-ads=\"article\" data-zaf-dynamic=\"article\" data-units-dynamic=\"article\" data-zaf-slot=\"true\">In order to fight Kindo'jan, players must complete all 9 chambers of the Labyrinth, but players have encountered some bugs preventing progress and ending the run prematurely.  <br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><a class=\"wh-button zam-button\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/guide/midnight/delves/labyrinth-of-kindojan-megadelve-nemesis-rewards\" data-style=\"cta\" data-variation=\"undefined\"><span class=\"wh-button-text body-text zam-button-text\" data-text-style=\"body-small-bold\" data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Labyrinth of Kindo'jan</span><span class=\"wh-button-icon zam-button-icon\"><img src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_cape_armor_troll_d_01.jpg\" alt=\"\"></span></a></div><div class=\"injected-ad-container\"><div class=\"htlad-desktop-dynamic-btf tude-ads\"><div id=\"desktop-dynamic-btf\" class=\"htl-ad\"></div></div></div><br><br>To fight Kindo'jan, players must complete all 9 chambers in the same run. On live servers, some serious bugs are preventing players from completing the objectives, forcing players to end their run early because there is no way to progress. This forces them to restart completely, which can be a very big time sink. <br><br>I personally have had 3 runs bug out in different areas:<ul class=\"exclude-units\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Returning the Bounty in Jin'ali's Refuge (Chamber #7) - No more adds would sapwn.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Failed Boss Credit in the Cave Towers (Chamber #3) - The boss didn't give credit for the objective.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Returning the Bounty in Opening Area (Chamber #1) - Unable to click on the sack to start the event.</div></li></ul><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><a href=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1305557.jpg\" id=\"1305557\"><img height=\"300\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1305557.jpg?maxHeight=300\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"content-image\" alt=\"Returning the Bounty 1\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1305558.jpg\" id=\"1305558\"><img height=\"300\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1305558.jpg?maxHeight=300\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"content-image\" alt=\"Returning the Bounty 2\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"></a>&nbsp;</div><br><br>Because the Returning the Bounty bug is in the opening area, I can no longer rotate the objectives, meaning this character is completely broken out of Labyrinths right now. There are other reports of issues with players not getting boss credit, such as the boss in the Taken Antiquities story in the Reliquary, though it seems to be inconsistent and doesn't always trigger.</div>\n            \n            <noscript>In order to fight Kindo'jan, players must complete all 9 chambers of the Labyrinth, but players have encountered some bugs preventing progress and ending the run prematurely. <br /><br />Labyrinth of Kindo'jan<br /><br />To fight Kindo'jan, players must complete all 9 chambers in the same run. On live servers, some serious bugs are preventing players from completing the objectives, forcing players to end their run early because there is no way to progress. This forces them to restart completely, which can be a very big time sink. <br /><br />I personally have had 3 runs bug out in different areas:<br /><ul><li>Returning the Bounty in Jin'ali's Refuge (Chamber #7) - No more adds would sapwn.</li><li>Failed Boss Credit in the Cave Towers (Chamber #3) - The boss didn't give credit for the objective.</li><li>Returning the Bounty in Opening Area (Chamber #1) - Unable to click on the sack to start the event.</li></ul><br /><br />Because the Returning the Bounty bug is in the opening area, I can no longer rotate the objectives, meaning this character is completely broken out of Labyrinths right now. There are other reports of issues with players not getting boss credit, such as the boss in the Taken Antiquities story in the Reliquary, though it seems to be inconsistent and doesn't always trigger.</noscript>            \n        ",
