      "en": "Post-Raid Campaign Cannot Be Completed - Blizzard Investigating",
      "es": "No se puede completar la campaña posterior al ataque: Blizzard está investigando"
    },
    "summary": {
      "en": "Post-Raid Campaign Cannot Be Completed - Blizzard Investigating...",
      "es": "No se puede completar la campaña posterior al ataque: Blizzard está investigando..."
    },
    "contentHtml": "\n            <div id=\"news-post-6acfad5ab3b5e1.82247717\" data-insert-ads=\"article\" data-zaf-dynamic=\"article\" data-units-dynamic=\"article\" data-zaf-slot=\"true\">Blizzard has announced that they are investigating an issue where the Post-Raid campaign cannot be completed. <br><br>After defeating Kith'ix, players are shown two cinematics: one right <a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/news/kithix-raid-finale-cinematic-383398\" data-contiguous=\"true\">after Kith'ix dies</a>, and the other during the <a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/news/post-raid-campaign-cutscene-spoilers-ahead-383404\" data-contiguous=\"true\">post-raid campaign</a>. After seeing both of these, the next quest <a class=\"icontiny\" data-game=\"wow\" data-type=\"quest\" data-entity=\"quest\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/quest=95813/what-the-world-sees\"><img alt=\"What the World Sees\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/quest-start-campaign.gif\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"> <span class=\"tinyicontxt\">What the World Sees</span></a> is bugged and cannot be completed right now.<div class=\"quote-box exclude-units last\" data-type=\"blizzard\" data-has-links=\"true\" data-has-source=\"true\" data-has-toggle=\"true\"><div class=\"quote-source\">Blizzard</div><div class=\"quote-header\"><a href=\"https://us.forums.blizzard.com/en/wow/t/2381366/16\" target=\"_blank\">View Original</a><a class=\"quote-toggle\" href=\"javascript:\" aria-label=\"Toggle quote visibility\"></a></div><div class=\"quote-body\" data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Thanks for the reports! We’re looking into the issues where the quests “Belly of the Beast” and “What the World Sees” cannot be completed.</div></div></div>\n            \n            <noscript>Blizzard has announced that they are investigating an issue where the Post-Raid campaign cannot be completed. <br /><br />After defeating Kith'ix, players are shown two cinematics: one right <a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/news/kithix-raid-finale-cinematic-383398\">after Kith'ix dies</a>, and the other during the <a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/news/post-raid-campaign-cutscene-spoilers-ahead-383404\">post-raid campaign</a>. After seeing both of these, the next quest <a href=\"/quest=95813/what-the-world-sees\">What the World Sees</a> is bugged and cannot be completed right now. <br /><br /><div class=\"quote-box\" data-type=\"blizzard\"><div class=\"quote-header\"></div><div class=\"quote-body\">Thanks for the reports! We’re looking into the issues where the quests “Belly of the Beast” and “What the World Sees” cannot be completed.</div></div></noscript>            \n        ",
